<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Autlan details dividend, share buyback.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Autlan details dividend, share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty miner Compania Minera Autlan said Tuesday a cash dividend of 20.2 million pesos was approved at its annual shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>The dividend is approximately 0.07 peso per share on the 294,180,000 shares outstanding and will be paid on the last business day of June, the company added.</p>
<p>&quot;In addition, shareholders approved the creation of a fund of up to 139.3 million pesos to purchase the company's shares in the market,&quot; Autlan added in a statement.</p>
<p>Autlan is the largest producer in North America of manganese alloys for the steel industry.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
</text>
